# Enterprise HRMS Solutions

Category: Business Management Solutions

Custom Human Resource Management Systems covering payroll, attendance, onboarding, and performance.

Streamline employee management and payroll compliance. Our custom HRMS solutions automate manual HR admin from onboarding to offboarding. Featuring custom shift schedules, automated tax and payroll compliance, holiday calendars, and employee self-service portals, our HRMS is designed to keep your workforce productive and your administration lean.

Key features:
- Automated Payroll: Calculate wages, taxes, and deductions instantly. Error-free payroll.
- Shift & Attendance: Biometric & geofenced check-ins with shift rotation logic. Precise tracking.
- Self-Service Portal: Let employees access payslips, request leaves, and upload documents. Reduced HR burden.
- Performance & Goals: Structured appraisal loops and KPI goal tracking. Objective assessments.

